PET EXPERIENCE

Raised undead earn no experience or levels.
Their final blows award normal character experience.

Conjured companions begin at level 1.
A companion final blow awards its own base monster XP,
alongside native experience credited to its owner.

Cumulative pet experience requirement:
  100 * (level - 1) * (level - 1)

Level 2:   100 XP
Level 10:  8100 XP
Level 20:  36100 XP
Level 40:  152100 XP
Level 60:  348100 XP

Companion level cannot exceed the owner's level.
Experience and levels survive logout, dismissal and restart.
Combat death or permanent release destroys that companion.
